WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.340
The twentieth century's two great

2
00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.128
communist revolutions came in Russia,

3
00:00:05.128 --> 00:00:06.532
and in China.

4
00:00:06.862 --> 00:00:07.807
In 1917,

5
00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:10.394
the Bolsheviks took power in

6
00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:12.214
Russia. In 1949,

7
00:00:12.214 --> 00:00:15.108
Mao proclaimed the People's Republic

8
00:00:15.108 --> 00:00:16.421
of China.

9
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.715
In February,

10
00:00:17.715 --> 00:00:19.010
the Tsar fell.

11
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:19.936
In October,

12
00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:22.610
Lenin's Bolsheviks seized power.

13
00:00:22.943 --> 00:00:25.796
Counter-revolution came too: fascism in

14
00:00:25.796 --> 00:00:28.594
Italy, and Nazism in Germany.

15
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.211
Your turn.

16
00:00:30.211 --> 00:00:32.265
When was it proclaimed?
